Hi Nathan,

Following our review of the 16 requests, I'm sending the approved partner bri=
efing and the short answers to keep beside a call for Calendar Q4 2026 / FY20=
26 Q3, covering October through December 2026.

The four items explain existing Patrol Check procedures: starting a draft fro=
m an accessible request at the same site, reviewing the copied fields and ent=
ering a new requested date, asking the site administrator to confirm access w=
hen the original cannot be opened, and reviewing and submitting a draft. Aski=
ng the administrator is not a grant of access; please wait for their answer. =
The other 12 requests remain under review.

A wider Site Board rollout remains under review. No rollout dates have been s=
et. If someone asks about a rollout schedule, please note the sites they have=
 in mind and send the question back to me rather than giving a date. The Engl=
ish materials do not by themselves confirm English UI availability.

Could we run through the explanation together on 15 September at 10:00 JST? W=
e can use the short answers to practise the questions likely to come up on a =
call.

Best,
Yumiko


